# landing: the closed list of states of the machine "Landing run".
# value<TAB>mark (initial, final or -)<TAB>kind (active, waiting, rest, final)<TAB>meaning
queued	initial	waiting	the run waits for a gate slot
rebasing	-	active	the commit is put on the tip of the line
resolving	-	active	a rebase conflict is being resolved
retesting	-	active	the journeys that the conflict affects run again
checking	-	active	the quick check runs
retrying	-	waiting	the runner failed, and the run is tried again or waits for the lead
landed	final	final	the commit is on the line
returned	final	final	the run gave the ticket back to building
withdrawn	final	final	the run was taken out of the queue
